These two Google Tag Manager templates are modified forks of templates
originally developed by Stape (https://stape.io, https://github.com/stape-io)
and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- meta-dedup-monitor-web.tpl
  forked from "Facebook Pixel by Stape"
  (https://github.com/stape-io/facebook-pixel-tag)

- meta-dedup-monitor-server.tpl
  forked from "Facebook Conversion API" by Stape
  (https://github.com/stape-io/facebook-tag)

Modifications (Meta Dedup Monitor project, 2026): the forks are collector-only —
instead of sending events to Meta, they send a faithful copy of each event
(same event_id) to a Meta Deduplication Monitor collector endpoint
(/c/browser and /c/server respectively). Event reconstruction, hashing and
consent logic from the original templates are unchanged.
